{"ref":"BDB, אָֽנָּ֫א","hw":"אָֽנָּ֫א","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">אָֽנָּ֫א</span></big>  <strong>interj. (</strong>from <span dir=\"rtl\">אָהּ</span> and <span dir=\"rtl\">נָא</span>, q.v.<strong>)</strong> a strong part. of entreaty, <strong>ah, now! I</strong> (or <strong>we</strong>) <strong>beseech thee!</strong> often sq. an imper.; <a data-ref=\"Genesis 50:17\" href=\"/Genesis.50.17\">Gn 50:17</a> (to Joseph) <span dir=\"rtl\">אָנָּא שָׂא נָא וג׳</span> <em>Ah, now!</em> forgive, we pray, etc., <a data-ref=\"Exodus 32:31\" href=\"/Exodus.32.31\">Ex 32:31</a> (to God); elsewhere always sq. <span dir=\"rtl\">י׳</span> or <span dir=\"rtl\">אֲדֹנָי</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 118:25\" href=\"/Psalms.118.25\">ψ 118:25</a><sup>(×2)</sup> <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 1:5\" href=\"/Nehemiah.1.5\">Ne 1:5</a>, <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 1:11\" href=\"/Nehemiah.1.11\">11</a> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 9:4\" href=\"/Daniel.9.4\">Dn 9:4</a>. Written <span dir=\"rtl\">אָֽנָּ֫ה</span> <a data-ref=\"II Kings 20:3\" href=\"/II_Kings.20.3\">2 K 20:3</a> (= <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 38:3\" href=\"/Isaiah.38.3\">Is 38:3</a>) <a data-ref=\"Jonah 1:14\" href=\"/Jonah.1.14\">Jon 1:14</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jonah 4:2\" href=\"/Jonah.4.2\">4:2</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 116:4\" href=\"/Psalms.116.4\">ψ 116:4</a>, <a data-ref=\"Psalms 116:16\" href=\"/Psalms.116.16\">16</a>.","next":"BDB, אנב","prev":"BDB, אֹן"}